Package: acer-predator-ph315-51-fan-control
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd
Description: manual fan control for the Acer Predator PH315-51
 fanctld is a root daemon that writes the embedded controller's fan
 registers directly, exposed to one local user over a Unix socket
 restricted by filesystem permissions. fanctl is the unprivileged CLI
 client (status/full/auto).
 .
 Register offsets are specific to the Acer Predator PH315-51 EC.
